#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use dynamic circuits with Estimator {#use-dynamic-circuits-with-estimator}"
msgstr "Estimator での動的回路の使用 {#use-dynamic-circuits-with-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since Estimator does not support dynamic circuits, you can use [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) and build your own measurement circuits instead.\n"
msgstr "Estimator は動的回路をサポートしていないため、[Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) を使用して独自の測定回路を構築できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To replicate Estimator's behavior, follow this process:\n"
msgstr "Estimator の動作を再現するには、以下のプロセスに従ってください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "1. Group the terms of all observables into a partition.  This can be done by using the [`PauliList` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList#group_qubit_wise_commuting), for example.\n"
#| "     <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "      You can use the [`BitArray`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BitArray#expectation_values) primitive attribute to compute the expectation values of the provided observables.\n"
#| "     </Admonition>\n"
#| "2. Execute one basis change circuit per partition (whichever basis change needs to be done for each partition). See the Measurement bases addon utility [`measurement_bases` module](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.html#qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.get_measurement_bases) for more information. For more information, see the [documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) for the Qiskit addon utilities package.\n"
#| "3. Add back together the results for each partition.\n"
msgid ""
"1. Group the terms of all observables into a partition.  This can be done by using the [`PauliList` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList#group_qubit_wise_commuting), for example.\n"
"     <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      You can use the [`BitArray`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BitArray#expectation_values) primitive attribute to compute the expectation values of the provided observables.\n"
"     </Admonition>\n"
"2. Execute one basis change circuit per partition (whichever basis change needs to be done for each partition). See the Measurement bases addon utility [`measurement_bases` module](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.html#qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.get_measurement_bases) for more information. For more information, see the [documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) for the Qiskit addon utilities package.\n"
"3. Add back together the results for each partition.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. すべてのオブザーバブルの項をパーティションにグループ化します。これは例えば [`PauliList` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList#group_qubit_wise_commuting) を使用して行うことができます。\n"
"     <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      [`BitArray`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BitArray#expectation_values) プリミティブ属性を使用して、提供されたオブザーバブルの期待値を計算できます。\n"
"     </Admonition>\n"
"2. パーティションごとに 1 つの基底変換回路を実行します（各パーティションに対して行う必要のある基底変換）。詳細については、Measurement bases アドオン・ユーティリティの [`measurement_bases` モジュール](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.html#qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.get_measurement_bases)を参照してください。Qiskit addon utilities パッケージの[ドキュメント](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/)もご覧ください。\n"
"3. 各パーティションの結果を合計して戻します。\n"

